#question(title: [Tangent line to a line?])[
  What is the equation of the line tangent to
  the graph of $y = x$ at the point with
  $x$--coordinate $7$?

  + $display(y = x + 7)$
  + $display(y = x)$
  + $display(y = 7)$
  + $display(x = 7)$
  + There is no tangent line at that point.
  + There is more than one tangent line at
    that point.
]
